## 18. Repeat limits and campaign payouts

```paradox
POD_combat_move_set_once_per   = { DURATION = round }
POD_combat_move_set_steal_gold = { VALUE = 15 }
POD_combat_move_set_gain_dread = { VALUE = 5 }
```

`DURATION` is `round` or `combat`, tracked per actor per move. Use `round` for
tempo effects that would otherwise lock a target out; use `combat` for summons,
transformations and high-impact attacks.

`steal_gold` takes up to N gold from the target, clamped to what it has, and
credits the actor. `gain_dread` gives the actor N dread. Both are
player-character-facing, single-target, and not clamped to any range.

