## 21. Every effect, A to Z

| Effect | Written as |
|---|---|
| AP drain | `POD_combat_move_set_ap_drain = { VALUE = n }` |
| AP drain, conditional | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = ap_drain VALUE = n)` (`single_enemy` only; sums with the base drain) |
| AP gain | `POD_combat_move_set_ap_gain = { VALUE = n }` |
| AP refund, conditional | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = ap_refund VALUE = n)` (the clause SUM stays below `AP_COST`) |
| Aggravated damage | `POD_combat_move_set_damage_class = { VALUE = aggravated }` |
| Aggravated healing | `POD_combat_move_set_hp_heal = { VALUE = n TYPE = aggravated }` |
| Aggravated retaliation | `POD_combat_move_set_retaliate_agg = yes` |
| Auto-hit | omit `requires_hit_roll` |
| Damage, HP | `POD_combat_move_set_hp_damage = { VALUE = n }` |
| Damage, morale | `POD_combat_move_set_morale_damage = { VALUE = n }` |
| Damage, self | `POD_combat_move_set_self_damage = { VALUE = n }` |
| Damage over time | `POD_combat_move_set_dot = { AMOUNT = n ROUNDS = n }` |
| Damage over time, morale | + `NAME = dot_morale` |
| Damage over time, conditional | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = dot VALUE = n)` |
| Dodge stance | `NAME = dodge` |
| Dodge bypass | `NAME = bypass_dodge` |
| Dread gain | `POD_combat_move_set_gain_dread = { VALUE = n }` |
| Drain / lifesteal | `set_hp_damage` + `set_hp_heal` + `set_heal_condition = on_hp_damage` + `NAME = drain` |
| Elemental damage | `POD_combat_move_set_damage_class = { VALUE = fire }` etc. |
| Energy gain, unconditional | `POD_combat_move_set_energy_gain = { VALUE = n }` |
| Convert damage to an element on one hit | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = change_class VALUE = 0)` + `POD_combat_move_clause_set_bonus_param = { PARAM = fire }` |
| Add separately typed conditional damage | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = damage VALUE = 1)` + `POD_combat_move_clause_set_bonus_param = { PARAM = aggravated }` (repeat with a different `PARAM` for up to three classes) |
| Morale heal, conditional (self) | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = self_morale_heal VALUE = n)` |
| Morale damage over time, conditional | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = morale_dot VALUE = n)` |
| Retaliation damage boost, conditional | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = retaliate_boost VALUE = n)` + a `retaliate_if_*` flag |
| Energy drain | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = energy_drain VALUE = n)` |
| Energy gain | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = energy_gain VALUE = n)` |
| Force aggravated on one hit | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = change_type VALUE = 0)` |
| Gate, move unusable unless | `POD_combat_move_set_condition = { MODE = gate ... }` |
| Bonus clause, one conditional rider | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = x VALUE = n)`; repeat for more riders |
| Bonus clause, hidden until earned | + `POD_combat_move_clause_set_hide = yes` |
| Bonus clause, identifier condition | + `POD_combat_move_clause_set_cond_param = { PARAM = key }` |
| Gold theft | `POD_combat_move_set_steal_gold = { VALUE = n }` |
| Guard | `NAME = set_guard` |
| Guard bypass | omit `checks_guard` |
| Guard strip | `NAME = remove_guard` |
| Healing, HP | `POD_combat_move_set_hp_heal = { VALUE = n TYPE = superficial }` |
| Healing, morale | `POD_combat_move_set_morale_heal = { VALUE = n }` |
| Healing the target, conditional | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = heal_target VALUE = n)` |
| Hit chance bonus, conditional | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = hit VALUE = n)` |
| Hit tier buff / debuff | `POD_combat_move_set_hit_buff_round = { TIER = n }` and its three siblings |
| Initiative debuff | `POD_combat_move_set_initiative_debuff = { VALUE = n }` |
| Marker modifier | `POD_combat_move_set_marker_modifier = { KEY = ... }` |
| Marker removal | `POD_combat_move_set_remove_marker = { KEY = ... TARGET = user\|target }` |
| Mind control | `NAME = mind_control` |
| Morale retaliation | `POD_combat_move_set_retaliate_morale = yes` |
| Once per round / combat | `POD_combat_move_set_once_per = { DURATION = round }` |
| Retaliation | `POD_combat_move_set_retaliate_damage = { VALUE = n }` + one `retaliate_if_*` flag |
| Rider, gate a heal / morale hit / recoil on the result | `POD_combat_move_set_heal_condition` and its two siblings |
| Soak tier buff / debuff | `POD_combat_move_set_soak_buff_round = { TIER = n }` and its three siblings |
| Spirit gate | `NAME = checks_spirit_gate` |
| Stance grant, conditional | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = stance_guard VALUE = 0)` etc. |
| Starter move | `NAME = is_starter_move` |
| Weapon move | `NAME = uses_weapon` |
| Weapon move, conditional | `CLAUSE(EFFECT = uses_weapon VALUE = 0)` |
| Stealth stance | `NAME = stealth` |
| Stealth bypass | `NAME = bypass_stealth` |
| Summon | `POD_combat_move_set_summon = { RECIPE = wraith }` |
| Summon, hostile | + `NAME = summon_hostile` |

`NAME = x` is shorthand for `POD_combat_move_set_flag = { NAME = x }`.

`CLAUSE(...)` is shorthand for
`POD_combat_move_add_bonus_clause = { TARGET = t PREDICATE = p THRESHOLD = n ... }`,
which also carries the clause's own condition. Repeat the call for each rider:
magnitudes sum, while tier effects use the highest tier.

